OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,FWildfires in eastern Washington state
OL,8,Fhave forced the evacuation of 60,000
OL,9,Fpeople and destroyed at least 600
OL,10,Fhomes and buildings, authorities said
OL,11,Fon Sunday.
OL,13,FThe fires in and around Spokane, the
OL,14,Fstate's second-largest city, burned
OL,15,Fabout 21 square kilometres over the
OL,16,Fweekend and were among dozens of
OL,17,Fwildfires across the Western US.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
