OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785766710
OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,FA total of about 1,000 square
OL,8,Fkilometres has burned across the
OL,9,Fstate, and some of the fires,
OL,10,Fincluding those in the Spokane area,
OL,11,Fhave not been contained.
OL,13,FFire and law enforcement officials
OL,14,Fsaid there had been no reports of
OL,15,Finjuries or people unaccounted for,
OL,16,Fbut they stressed it was early in the
OL,17,Fresponse effort.
OL,19,FOfficials also said that the evacuees
OL,20,Fin Spokane included patients at its US
OL,21,FVeterans Affairs hospital.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
