PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785766710
OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,FVideo from the Spokane area showed
OL,8,Fbuildings on fire, black smoke near
OL,9,Fneighbourhoods, and the ruins of
OL,10,Fhomes, with only chimneys still
OL,11,Fstanding.
OL,13,FSeveral officials expressed concern
OL,14,Fthat the area is unlikely to get a
OL,15,Fbreak from the weather, which is
OL,16,Fexpected to remain dry.
OL,18,F"We are not out of danger," US Senator
OL,19,FMaria Cantwell said during a news
OL,20,Fconference with federal, state and
OL,21,Flocal officials in Spokane.
OL,26,@zD@AOUzD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
