OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785766710
OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,F"The next couple of days will be
OL,8,Fchallenging."
OL,10,FAuthorities have set up a shelter at
OL,11,Fthe city's main convention centre,
OL,12,Fwhere about 400 people were staying,
OL,13,Fofficials said Sunday.
OL,15,FInvestigators have yet to determine
OL,16,Fhow the blazes started.
OL,18,FElsewhere, fires continued to burn in
OL,19,FIdaho, Oregon and Utah.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@MO]
