OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785766710
OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,FCrews using bulldozers and helicopters
OL,8,Fcontinued for a 10th day to fight a
OL,9,Ffire that has burned about 1,360
OL,10,Fsquare kilometres of grassland in
OL,11,Fwestern Idaho and eastern Oregon.
OL,13,FThe area is home to cattle ranches,
OL,14,Fand authorities said the fire is
OL,15,Fthreatening more than 600 homes and
OL,16,F800 other structures.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
