OL,3,CWildfires in Washington state force
OL,4,C60,000 evacuations and burn 600
OL,5,Cbuildings
OL,7,FIn central Utah, a massive blaze more
OL,8,Fthan doubled in size over the weekend,
OL,9,Fjumping from 41 square kilometres to
OL,10,Fabout 145 square kilometres by Sunday
OL,11,Fmorning. More than 100 cattle have
OL,12,Fbeen killed, according to local law
OL,13,Fenforcement.
OL,15,FOfficials called the fire
OL,16,F"catastrophic" as heavy winds helped
OL,17,Fflames jump containment lines
OL,18,Fovernight.
